{"number":100,"name":"سُورَةُ العَادِيَاتِ","englishName":"Al-Aadiyaat","englishNameTranslation":"The Chargers","numberOfAyahs":11,"items":[{"id":"q:100:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلْعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبْحًۭا","en":"By the racers, panting,","bn":"শপথ উর্ধ্বশ্বাসে চলমান অশ্বসমূহের,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/1"},{"id":"q:100:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَٱلْمُورِيَٰتِ قَدْحًۭا","en":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","bn":"অতঃপর ক্ষুরাঘাতে অগ্নিবিচ্ছুরক অশ্বসমূহের","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/2"},{"id":"q:100:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَٱلْمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبْحًۭا","en":"And the chargers at dawn,","bn":"অতঃপর প্রভাতকালে আক্রমণকারী অশ্বসমূহের","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/3"},{"id":"q:100:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَأَثَرْنَ بِهِۦ نَقْعًۭا","en":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,","bn":"ও যারা সে সময়ে ধুলি উৎক্ষিপ্ত করে","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/4"},{"id":"q:100:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَوَسَطْنَ بِهِۦ جَمْعًا","en":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively,","bn":"অতঃপর যারা শক্রদলের অভ্যন্তরে ঢুকে পড়ে-","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/5"},{"id":"q:100:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٌۭ","en":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","bn":"নিশ্চয় মানুষ তার পালনকর্তার প্রতি অকৃতজ্ঞ।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/6"},{"id":"q:100:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٌۭ","en":"And indeed, he is to that a witness.","bn":"এবং সে অবশ্য এ বিষয়ে অবহিত","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/7"},{"id":"q:100:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","en":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.","bn":"এবং সে নিশ্চিতই ধন-সম্পদের ভালবাসায় মত্ত।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/8"},{"id":"q:100:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"۞ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ","en":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered","bn":"সে কি জানে না, যখন কবরে যা আছে, তা উত্থিত হবে","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/9"},{"id":"q:100:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ","en":"And that within the breasts is obtained,","bn":"এবং অন্তরে যা আছে, তা অর্জন করা হবে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/10"},{"id":"q:100:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":100,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Al-Aadiyaat","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ لَّخَبِيرٌۢ","en":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted.","bn":"সেদিন তাদের কি হবে, সে সম্পর্কে তাদের পালনকর্তা সবিশেষ জ্ঞাত।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/100/11"}]}